  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Siege Regiment",
    "summary": "As each battle round starts, pick 1 type of artillery support. It lasts until that battle round ends and affects at most 2 units at Incursion, 3 at Strike Force or 4 at Onslaught:\n\n- **Creeping Barrage**: roll 1 D6 at a time for each enemy unit over 12\" away from all your models on the battlefield, stopping once the most units allowed are shaken. On a 5+, that unit is shaken: -2\" Move and -2 to its **Charge rolls**.\n- **Incendiary Bombardment**: pick enemy units over 12\" away from all your models on the battlefield. They are scattered and can't have the **[Benefit of Cover](vsdata:core-rule/benefit-of-cover)**.\n- **Smoke Shells**: pick units from your army. They have **[Stealth](vsdata:core-ability/stealth)**.",
